  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759831,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "### 16 Tales II: China - Sony PlayStation\n\nEmbark on a captivating journey to ancient China with *16 Tales II: China* for the PlayStation! Developed by The Lightspan Partnership, this educational adventure brings Chinese folklore and history to life through four immersive 15-minute video programs.\n\nExplore vibrant landscapes and encounter legendary figures as you unravel captivating tales rooted in Chinese culture. Learn about the significance of the Dragon Boat Festival, the artistry of calligraphy, and the wisdom of Confucius, all while experiencing engaging storytelling.\n\n*16 Tales II* combines stunning visuals with interactive elements, encouraging players to actively participate in the learning process. While not a traditional action game, the experience is rich in cultural detail and offers a unique blend of education and entertainment suitable for players of all ages. Discover the beauty and wonder of China – one tale at a time! Experience the rich tapestry of Chinese stories and lore, presented in a way that’s both accessible and unforgettable."
    },
